**Himfahric** (/' *hɪmfɑrɪk* /, [[himfahric|Himfahric]]: *𐑣𐑦𐑥𐑓𐑸𐑦𐑒* ) is the language spoken in the areas of [[himfahrum|Himfahrum]], [[the-rift|The Rift]] and [[ukrasha|Ukrasha]].

